{"4916600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drop Loot", "steam_appid": 4916600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4935160], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/bcb20a15129e9c53790060c3663463cc.webp?t=1787562427\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras_big/bcb20a15129e9c53790060c3663463cc.webp?t=1787562427 width=1560 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop pairs of loot onto a board crawling with monsters. Match swords and bombs beside enemies to deal damage, or fire bows and explosive spells across the board. Match hearts to heal, shields to absorb incoming attacks, and coins to fund your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Larger weapon clusters hit harder, while gold-tinted attacks land double-damage criticals. Every drop can finish a monster, keep you alive, or set up a nasty surprise for an incoming wave of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matches create space. Space creates bigger matches. Bigger matches create chains. It takes just one drop to turn the whole dungeon into fireworks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/91c5741c16d136090b4f3992f39627a1.poster.avif?t=1787562427\" width=1170 height=728 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/91c5741c16d136090b4f3992f39627a1.webm?t=1787562427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/91c5741c16d136090b4f3992f39627a1.mp4?t=1787562427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/0bb4a223f9bdc01e023c35bc20a1b363.avif?t=1787562427\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras_big/0bb4a223f9bdc01e023c35bc20a1b363.webp?t=1787562427 width=1560 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your gold in shops on dozens of stackable powers and run-changing upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One power is an advantage, but several is a strategy. Stack the right effects together and that strategy becomes an engine that feeds match into match until the entire board clears itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with what drops, discover new interactions, and hunt for the synergy that breaks the dungeon before it breaks you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/e7eb9d96bbe508869a24f353fcb5dfd2.poster.avif?t=1787562427\" width=1170 height=728 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/e7eb9d96bbe508869a24f353fcb5dfd2.webm?t=1787562427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/e7eb9d96bbe508869a24f353fcb5dfd2.mp4?t=1787562427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/62533bac15886354d5b68864436b469a.avif?t=1787562427\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras_big/62533bac15886354d5b68864436b469a.webp?t=1787562427 width=1560 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies bring their health, attack damage, and armor directly onto the board. Armor absorbs your hits, crowded boards limit your options, and every missed opportunity gives the monsters more time to tear you apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses come armed with signature attacks that force you to adapt your build and rethink how you use the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you descend, the stronger they become. Along the way, you’ll face regular bosses, with a final boss waiting at the end of each dungeon. Defeat it, and descent continues in endless mode - where there is always another depth, and it is always nastier than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/c88a44a9fc437bcc2b22e3b6e4eca5b5.poster.avif?t=1787562427\" width=1170 height=728 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/c88a44a9fc437bcc2b22e3b6e4eca5b5.webm?t=1787562427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/c88a44a9fc437bcc2b22e3b6e4eca5b5.mp4?t=1787562427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/f4abfdb8c76c1e22d21b945b5ed62f4e.avif?t=1787562427\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras_big/f4abfdb8c76c1e22d21b945b5ed62f4e.webp?t=1787562427 width=1560 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character, item, enemy, and boss is brought to life with chunky, hand-drawn pixel art and animation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind it all is a reactive particle system that turns every fight into a fireworks show. Fire ignites bombs. Water douses fire. Lightning zaps through wet tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kills explode, the mess stays behind, and every chain reaction adds another layer to the destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/8b5ddc1d8b7ee5311cbc39b29e7fe038.poster.avif?t=1787562427\" width=1170 height=728 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/8b5ddc1d8b7ee5311cbc39b29e7fe038.webm?t=1787562427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/8b5ddc1d8b7ee5311cbc39b29e7fe038.mp4?t=1787562427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/8653d89bc95863ccf95b5230cee9d85d.avif?t=1787562427\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras_big/8653d89bc95863ccf95b5230cee9d85d.webp?t=1787562427 width=1560 height=78 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless depths with escalating enemies and difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of shop items and stackable powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergies capable of taking over the entire board</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses with signature attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critical hits and cascading chain reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn and hand-animated pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric soundtrack by Abstraction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard, mouse, and gamepad support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite ASMR - with an unreasonable amount of blood.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/bcb20a15129e9c53790060c3663463cc.webp?t=1787562427\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras_big/bcb20a15129e9c53790060c3663463cc.webp?t=1787562427 width=1560 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop pairs of loot onto a board crawling with monsters. Match swords and bombs beside enemies to deal damage, or fire bows and explosive spells across the board. Match hearts to heal, shields to absorb incoming attacks, and coins to fund your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Larger weapon clusters hit harder, while gold-tinted attacks land double-damage criticals. Every drop can finish a monster, keep you alive, or set up a nasty surprise for an incoming wave of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matches create space. Space creates bigger matches. Bigger matches create chains. It takes just one drop to turn the whole dungeon into fireworks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/91c5741c16d136090b4f3992f39627a1.poster.avif?t=1787562427\" width=1170 height=728 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/91c5741c16d136090b4f3992f39627a1.webm?t=1787562427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/91c5741c16d136090b4f3992f39627a1.mp4?t=1787562427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/0bb4a223f9bdc01e023c35bc20a1b363.avif?t=1787562427\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras_big/0bb4a223f9bdc01e023c35bc20a1b363.webp?t=1787562427 width=1560 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your gold in shops on dozens of stackable powers and run-changing upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One power is an advantage, but several is a strategy. Stack the right effects together and that strategy becomes an engine that feeds match into match until the entire board clears itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with what drops, discover new interactions, and hunt for the synergy that breaks the dungeon before it breaks you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/e7eb9d96bbe508869a24f353fcb5dfd2.poster.avif?t=1787562427\" width=1170 height=728 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/e7eb9d96bbe508869a24f353fcb5dfd2.webm?t=1787562427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/e7eb9d96bbe508869a24f353fcb5dfd2.mp4?t=1787562427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/62533bac15886354d5b68864436b469a.avif?t=1787562427\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras_big/62533bac15886354d5b68864436b469a.webp?t=1787562427 width=1560 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies bring their health, attack damage, and armor directly onto the board. Armor absorbs your hits, crowded boards limit your options, and every missed opportunity gives the monsters more time to tear you apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses come armed with signature attacks that force you to adapt your build and rethink how you use the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you descend, the stronger they become. Along the way, you’ll face regular bosses, with a final boss waiting at the end of each dungeon. Defeat it, and descent continues in endless mode - where there is always another depth, and it is always nastier than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/c88a44a9fc437bcc2b22e3b6e4eca5b5.poster.avif?t=1787562427\" width=1170 height=728 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/c88a44a9fc437bcc2b22e3b6e4eca5b5.webm?t=1787562427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/extras/c88a44a9fc437bcc2b22e3b6e4eca5b5.mp4?t=1787562427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph