t=1787562427 width=1560 height=78 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless depths with escalating enemies and difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of shop items and stackable powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergies capable of taking over the entire board</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses with signature attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critical hits and cascading chain reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn and hand-animated pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric soundtrack by Abstraction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard, mouse, and gamepad support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite ASMR - with an unreasonable amount of blood.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Drop Loot is a loot-matching, synergy-chaining, monster-exploding… roguelite dungeon crawler. Match tiles to deal damage and heal, stack powers to create chain reactions, descend to the heart of the well and paint it all red.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian", "reviews": "“This Strange New Tetris Roguelike is Really Fun”<br>Retromation<br><br>“This Tetris Roguelike is a LOT of Fun”<br>Olexa<br><br>“THIS ROGUELIKE TETRIS IS AMAZING”<br>Max Palaro<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/a8156966f19318f4a06b257cac931118c3ceba79/header.jpg?t=1787562427", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/ffd1ac0a57d0957ded86b138a8e8f17564034155/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787562427", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916600/ffd1ac0a57d0957ded86b138a8e8f17564034155/capsule_18